            "review_title": "Review at Gat Tan Doi",
            "review_text": "Mark C\nCan Tho, Vietnam51 contributions\n0\nThis is a beautiful, relaxing little cafe.\nJan 2020 • Solo\nThis is a beautiful, relaxing little cafe. I stumbled across it by chance and I’ve been back every day since. Really nice coffees, teas, fruit juice and smoothies and very friendly staff. Well worth dropping by to chill out for a while if you’re in the area. 😎\nWritten January 17, 2020",
